# Also (iceland check 1): boot-arg agx-surface64=1 (or NATIVE_METAL_SURFACE64=1; OFF by default) answers
# iosurfaceTextureAlignmentBytes 64 instead of the Mac GPU profile's 16 (fact from UniXNU NativeMetal, MIT: iconservicesagent aborts
